---
/** A connector between two nodes: a hairline with an arrowhead drawn from borders. */
---

<div class="flex items-center justify-center py-1 text-border-strong" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="h-4 w-px bg-border-strong"></span>
  <span class="-ml-px border-x-[3px] border-t-[5px] border-x-transparent border-t-border-strong"
  ></span>
</div>
